OL,3,CMan arrested over death of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman found in suitcase in Athens
OL,6,FA man has been arrested following the
OL,7,Fdeath of a Scottish woman whose body
OL,8,Fwas found inside a suitcase in Athens.
OL,10,FThe 26-year-old man, who Greek police
OL,11,Fsaid was a foreigner, was arrested
OL,12,Fafter the death of Elisabeth-Jane Ross.
OL,14,FThe body of 38-year-old Ms Ross was
OL,15,Fdiscovered inside a suitcase by a
OL,16,Fhomeless man in a derelict building in
OL,17,Fthe Kypseli area of Athens on July 18.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
