PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785692891
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman found in suitcase in Athens
OL,6,FShe is believed to have died between
OL,7,Ffive and seven days before she was
OL,8,Ffound, though someone was reportedly
OL,9,Fusing her mobile phone to send
OL,10,Fmessages purporting to be from Ms Ross.
OL,12,FThe Hellenic Police, Greece's national
OL,13,Fforce, were able to identify the
OL,14,Fvictim using fingerprints.
OL,16,FMs Ross, who is understood to be from
OL,17,FEdinburgh, entered Greece on June 26
OL,18,Fand was initially staying with friends
OL,19,Fin Piraeus.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
