FL,305,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785692891
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman found in suitcase in Athens
OL,6,FShe is then said to have gone to meet
OL,7,Fwith American friends in another part
OL,8,Fof the Greek capital, but it is
OL,9,Funclear if this ever happened.
OL,11,FThe Hellenic Police said they analysed
OL,12,Fvideo footage to identify the suspect,
OL,13,Fwho confessed on Thursday.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
