CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785692891
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman found in suitcase in Athens
OL,6,FThe 26-year-old man is believed to
OL,7,Fhave put her body into a suitcase,
OL,8,Ftaking it to the abandoned site where
OL,9,Fit was found.
OL,11,FIn the following days he is said to
OL,12,Fhave used her bank card to withdraw
OL,13,Fmoney.
OL,15,FA replica pistol and a knife were
OL,16,Ffound at the suspect's home and police
OL,17,Fhave filed a case against him for
OL,18,Fmanslaughter, robbery and violation of
OL,19,Fweapons laws.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
