PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785692891
OL,3,CMan arrested over death of Scottish
OL,4,Cwoman found in suitcase in Athens
OL,6,FThe Foreign and Commonwealth Office
OL,7,Fsaid earlier: "Our thoughts are with
OL,8,FElisabeth's family during this
OL,9,Fdifficult time. We are providing
OL,10,Fconsular support and are in contact
OL,11,Fwith the local authorities."
OL,13,FA Police Scotland spokesperson said:
OL,14,F"We are aware of the death of a
OL,15,FScottish woman in Athens and are
OL,16,Fliaising with authorities in Greece.
OL,17,FOfficers are providing support to her
OL,18,Ffamily in Scotland."
